  "targets": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s03-p082-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Clerical workers are subject to quotas, routines, and constant monitoring by their managers.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9b60aa163b26762f0a4464628c2ae670967da5aa8a2c4259edfa4fdf8890939e",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s03-p082-02115-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "c85daf08133f30ce375364c6a0c7981a37dc2485e5ccb21dc840ed0cfa1ba3ab",
      "passageSha256": "78b4335778fecc82b1d96ef0ff7b3fec4756973f1a9d75a6ce96db4519e3199a",
      "pdfPages": [
        82
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s03-p082-04065-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Sociologist Melvin Kohn found some evidence in support of Marx’s speculations.",
      "sentenceSha256": "27d6e736903ffee168dcf292a0391516270c6cc99b7cb798c31d8df52fb32067",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s03-p082-04065-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "dc89cb98e69167838d24cc25439a58087eab00f3e0b23316a33428912686cea6",
      "passageSha256": "7ef8aa01c4522ff322014ce6cc44031ccd856c65f910526bb590e92af3f346fc",
      "pdfPages": [
        82
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Kagan’s idea of “diluted emotion” is not exactly the same as Marx’s idea of alienation; Marx’s alienation is much darker.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ece28b1a37aac5c4efd9ca2d12200b9cbf232d4eaa080e3e22ce8d13c8e844dd",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "0d426d2e32f6123f07b3cde172f197781a82b2b6769e5d0377befaae0dd273c7",
      "passageSha256": "0fcc533fdfdc7e4dd1d70a01857af5c0ce68eda044519b393e0e9a9c1257e286",
      "pdfPages": [
        82,
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-s004",
      "sentenceText": "After reading Kohn’s study, I was curious about the psychological consequences of the division of labor, specifically its effects on happiness, meaning, and psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9004e9dfbc8dc337105f4930110cf928f50edb36a1139c8b976aeec08b394ada",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "0d426d2e32f6123f07b3cde172f197781a82b2b6769e5d0377befaae0dd273c7",
      "passageSha256": "0fcc533fdfdc7e4dd1d70a01857af5c0ce68eda044519b393e0e9a9c1257e286",
      "pdfPages": [
        82,
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Does the division of labor take away a full range of emotional experiences in favor of machinelike efficiency?",
      "sentenceSha256": "7643c9d0553aa45350b49e2c1b592650f6a77c83c1cd412ce865e8e3f4155fc0",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p082-06525-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "db2ec8648777bed7493b98205d817bd878f6e04f89bb222a564cb9415925bfb6",
      "passageSha256": "808be49e6d41dd6960a6b8de70dc7964906cd9860a8851c826160fda5dabd068",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "To answer these questions, my graduate student Youngjae Cha and I designed an online assembly task.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ccb3b23b0a1109104cf255239df128c6a5010e35a49785a3e8e6edf947c27f63",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "d382fc341560594fbdfc0c025ec591ffef97699339081224e3d311db20e7a0a0",
      "passageSha256": "d209835d39fae796a0db39c723945697b21eee9d94fd1f8b52753b59a8dac559",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Participants were invited to a designated Zoom link at a prescheduled time, where they were greeted by our research assistant.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a3b7807cbf85fc7a592684908a3d355739652bc76a7b8083820a8ca8b54d3082",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "d382fc341560594fbdfc0c025ec591ffef97699339081224e3d311db20e7a0a0",
      "passageSha256": "d209835d39fae796a0db39c723945697b21eee9d94fd1f8b52753b59a8dac559",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Then they were told that they had been assigned to either one aspect of the assembly (the division of labor condition) or the whole production by themselves (everyone assembled all parts of a motorcycle; once they finished assembling one motorcycle, they moved on to another one).",
      "sentenceSha256": "16435ec3508061183ac270afba8976bde4850ee9046073d73174f0d94abd4d9e",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "7ed99c2e2513f2b723faa44e935c4268da68deeb1ae97ff410bbdfbea191b4bf",
      "passageSha256": "5828be84c38b4ebe89acb51180b5b49cbb4cbba01f28ac7a39c0c1d04f54e851",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s008",
      "sentenceText": "We encouraged participants to produce as many motorcycles as possible.",
      "sentenceSha256": "104fa96c82f5d44472ae4d25a6887d72eefd549038ee3874916743f498c716cf",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "7ed99c2e2513f2b723faa44e935c4268da68deeb1ae97ff410bbdfbea191b4bf",
      "passageSha256": "5828be84c38b4ebe89acb51180b5b49cbb4cbba01f28ac7a39c0c1d04f54e851",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s009",
      "sentenceText": "At the end of the experiment, we asked them how happy they felt, how meaningful they thought the task was, and how psychologically rich they felt.",
      "sentenceSha256": "efc664c184dc06dc4ebe1214d1fd5b2fccbb34cf15c0f4a0a26127ea5b5f2be6",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "3c7ccdf9533f4e31788d5e90232d6543163b973eb53b9537f7372208b8d649fd",
      "passageSha256": "cfe2aab5eee8249fd1834916d5880904cbcdb97254f79a1392ccc33abb1c0757",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s010",
      "sentenceText": "In terms of productivity, participants in the division of labor condition did far better than those in the whole production condition.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ed97a45e17bce3a16e8722e530eeb6b7a370c2200fcfe973ea0c608d7fab82f7",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "3c7ccdf9533f4e31788d5e90232d6543163b973eb53b9537f7372208b8d649fd",
      "passageSha256": "cfe2aab5eee8249fd1834916d5880904cbcdb97254f79a1392ccc33abb1c0757",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-s014",
      "sentenceText": "The division of labor increased production by four times!",
      "sentenceSha256": "9e515c85a30fb8cb9df4667281eb041ba1e4ca46e900d6a4d0017a5d153a73a6",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-02115-r013-014",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "2dcba5d34f11a0bc92b289700e2854bda0c157a943e5f13f0ead56aa35fcbe29",
      "passageSha256": "d35d8fe65d95a09f6f0f03bc64ca08017ccee7b56343b2cfc48b2792e421ec29",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But did the division of labor come at any psychological cost?",
      "sentenceSha256": "0e56024e983ea23006c324b7fb10a86b905391ffde3ed6aed753c676d3ccc673",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "ecdaeb2ceb31d93b7451cdea02dd340cefee629cd717df7bc7a9488c2e80d4ca",
      "passageSha256": "7dc913abd77098ca58babbe3d30cec0e20c3df1be5d57cd3fcdbbf5bbd9f77b8",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In terms of happiness, no.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e36efef9dd013c3ec64dca2d62d1d272d8f8926fce5ffe0546185bcbdc7e7f5",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "ecdaeb2ceb31d93b7451cdea02dd340cefee629cd717df7bc7a9488c2e80d4ca",
      "passageSha256": "7dc913abd77098ca58babbe3d30cec0e20c3df1be5d57cd3fcdbbf5bbd9f77b8",
      "pdfPages": [
        83
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-s007",
      "sentenceText": "That is, the division of labor made the task more boring, monotonous, and less interesting.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9018aec3da17a9211b890ac141307e154425fd40f979526c32e529a6c5be4f20",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "d0872c37b2c534ad727c78ef1e63c6c61e82fb45796d5755d336d71004840658",
      "passageSha256": "acdf9fef608d42e9baf604ed2d39b0a94538ea2d25ce935d5635966743cd822c",
      "pdfPages": [
        83,
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Assembling a whole motorcycle by yourself was not efficient.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dca334d715ce36c6517ba0ef4855a4a4fe29a69be67395e8ba14ad2a10f3d0d3",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "d0872c37b2c534ad727c78ef1e63c6c61e82fb45796d5755d336d71004840658",
      "passageSha256": "acdf9fef608d42e9baf604ed2d39b0a94538ea2d25ce935d5635966743cd822c",
      "pdfPages": [
        83,
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Indeed, it was quite the opposite.",
      "sentenceSha256": "80b649556ce58a4d227f3f0207471ae239a0c56dfb624424379d2e5836048195",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s04-p083-06405-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-032",
      "parentFingerprint": "bd65c66bedcb1edd955261790908e343fc79defbca32e7f37d94fc150d2f1e9e",
      "passageSha256": "8dae7369b6bd47532c37e87e56ab066323a2b7ad9076c59242f368c403d6e16b",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-02430-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Imagine working at a consulting firm and being placed on a big collaborative project with many others.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d77f7b63123b18c657f67af488b58e4e39cf3264b4ac07ceaeae00e6e61a0c4c",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-02430-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "cd79f2b952957ae8780e68a725896a706e0e5307ea300fe16a81f7fe1c1abf5f",
      "passageSha256": "96c5723602958048832a4f619c6da554979c8c219cd7e8a31030be8193cccbff",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-02430-s003",
      "sentenceText": "What would it be like to have a job like this?",
      "sentenceSha256": "a5ee6eff4027b29b54d6417717493d37cc775e9c26e29b8d066bcec039fb7a55",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-02430-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "cd79f2b952957ae8780e68a725896a706e0e5307ea300fe16a81f7fe1c1abf5f",
      "passageSha256": "96c5723602958048832a4f619c6da554979c8c219cd7e8a31030be8193cccbff",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Now imagine working in a consulting firm where you work independently.",
      "sentenceSha256": "14a1bdd2138f397339ef51c567d3cb40390988c44ee8d552bd012b8830e35c70",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "947787158aa87c7bf96832014e6277c0460ecbf15fdf971fe54cc382aa4028e5",
      "passageSha256": "1a3f55bc445d6d17e17aba7ce38b83875e3389c5e0345c4f4c346716cd1dfd52",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-s002",
      "sentenceText": "You are assigned to a big project that demands various tasks.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a5b2681eea140501d12b282d7b12649479cf7be9f9530d14a85289ab35bcc994",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "947787158aa87c7bf96832014e6277c0460ecbf15fdf971fe54cc382aa4028e5",
      "passageSha256": "1a3f55bc445d6d17e17aba7ce38b83875e3389c5e0345c4f4c346716cd1dfd52",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-s004",
      "sentenceText": "What would it be like to have a job like this?",
      "sentenceSha256": "a5ee6eff4027b29b54d6417717493d37cc775e9c26e29b8d066bcec039fb7a55",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-03210-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "947787158aa87c7bf96832014e6277c0460ecbf15fdf971fe54cc382aa4028e5",
      "passageSha256": "1a3f55bc445d6d17e17aba7ce38b83875e3389c5e0345c4f4c346716cd1dfd52",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-03990-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In a study to test this, we asked half of a sample of UVA students to imagine the first scenario, and the other half to imagine the second scenario.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b868c95b4c0b1832dfe416bb24ea6ce93d365deef08ce21dc122fa6bd637280f",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-03990-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "b82c20ea8f6fcf43e55a1c0b7a1888892679d09050151c7e516c83fbaeecd0e1",
      "passageSha256": "a0c273bfa1e12f760589924e98f9947b7dabcb08e2e3e233bca58aca58464aea",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s003",
      "sentenceText": "We kept the experimental setup for this study the same as for the consulting scenario experiment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "782efcb16c667f113f7e30bd52e51caa130bf43606c025a2fe445e288424858c",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "d71d39c21395ece7ce8a20a441534ab88c5e94cd4416946161cf3707cc4f0699",
      "passageSha256": "be709eaa8c02f4e318ab9fb604801fb5966369cc422004245c6d01fae42dcacb",
      "pdfPages": [
        84
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-s004",
      "sentenceText": "However, instead of asking them how they would feel when thinking about their lives working in a consulting firm, we asked participants to complete a trivia task.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4fa6b257b50c6e55c95c27d5dff958dc9b9ce5be1a66fd30901b29ba8843d0ff",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s05-p084-05940-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-037",
